{"t":"say","text":"I'll build a fully serverless REST API using Function Compute behind an API Gateway, with Tair and Tablestore for pay-per-use data."}
{"t":"req","text":"Serverless, pay only for what you use"}
{"t":"plan","products":["mobile-app","httpdns","esa","cloud-native-api-gateway","waf","fc","tair","tablestore","sls"]}
{"t":"group","id":"internet","kind":"external","label":"Internet","parent":null}
{"t":"node","id":"app","product":"mobile-app","label":"Mobile app","group":"internet","why":"Native app calling the REST API over the internet."}
{"t":"node","id":"dns","product":"httpdns","label":"HTTPDNS","group":null,"why":"Prevents DNS hijacking and improves scheduling for mobile clients."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-app-dns","from":"app","to":"dns","kind":"resolve"}
{"t":"group","id":"edge","kind":"edge","label":"Edge","parent":null}
{"t":"node","id":"esa","product":"esa","label":"ESA","group":"edge","why":"Accelerates dynamic API traffic and provides DDoS defense at the edge."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-app-esa","from":"app","to":"esa","label":"HTTPS"}
{"t":"group","id":"sg","kind":"region","label":"Singapore (ap-southeast-1)","parent":null}
{"t":"group","id":"vpc","kind":"vpc","label":"API VPC","parent":"sg"}
{"t":"node","id":"gw","product":"cloud-native-api-gateway","label":"API Gateway","group":"vpc","zones":["a","b"],"why":"Managed gateway for REST routing, auth and throttling; scales to zero."}
{"t":"node","id":"waf","product":"waf","label":"WAF","group":"vpc","attachTo":"gw","why":"Blocks OWASP attacks on the API gateway in cloud-native mode."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-esa-gw","from":"esa","to":"gw","label":"origin"}
{"t":"node","id":"api","product":"fc","label":"API functions","group":"sg","why":"Serverless functions handling REST logic; billed per request and duration."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-gw-api","from":"gw","to":"api","label":"invoke"}
{"t":"node","id":"cache","product":"tair","label":"Session cache","group":"vpc","zones":["a","b"],"why":"In-memory cache for sessions and hot data, reducing cold starts."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-api-cache","from":"api","to":"cache","label":"read/write"}
{"t":"node","id":"db","product":"tablestore","label":"Data store","group":"sg","why":"Serverless NoSQL storage billed per read/write unit, ideal for spiky traffic."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-api-db","from":"api","to":"db","label":"data"}
{"t":"node","id":"logs","product":"sls","label":"Logs","group":"sg","why":"Centralized logs and metrics for functions and gateway."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-api-logs","from":"api","to":"logs","kind":"control"}
{"t":"done","summary":"Serverless REST API with HTTPDNS, ESA, Cloud-native API Gateway with WAF, Function Compute, Tair and Tablestore."}

{"t":"say","text":"I'll draw a Kubernetes architecture with ACK, MSE for service discovery, an API gateway, RocketMQ, Tair cache and PolarDB."}
{"t":"plan","products":["users","dns","alb","cloud-native-api-gateway","ack","mse","rocketmq","tair","polardb","sls","acr"]}
{"t":"group","id":"internet","kind":"external","label":"Internet","parent":null}
{"t":"node","id":"users","product":"users","label":"Users","group":"internet","why":"External clients calling the platform."}
{"t":"node","id":"dns","product":"dns","label":"Cloud DNS","group":null,"why":"Resolves domain to the load balancer."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-users-dns","from":"users","to":"dns","kind":"resolve"}
{"t":"group","id":"sg","kind":"region","label":"Singapore (ap-southeast-1)","parent":null}
{"t":"group","id":"vpc","kind":"vpc","label":"Microservices VPC","parent":"sg"}
{"t":"node","id":"alb","product":"alb","label":"ALB","group":"vpc","zones":["a","b"],"why":"Ingress load balancer spreading traffic across zones."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-users-alb","from":"users","to":"alb","label":"HTTPS"}
{"t":"node","id":"gateway","product":"cloud-native-api-gateway","label":"API Gateway","group":"vpc","zones":["a","b"],"why":"Single entry point routing to 20 microservices."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-alb-gateway","from":"alb","to":"gateway"}
{"t":"node","id":"ack","product":"ack","label":"ACK Cluster","group":"vpc","zones":["a","b"],"why":"Runs the 20 Java microservices on Kubernetes."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-gateway-ack","from":"gateway","to":"ack"}
{"t":"node","id":"mse","product":"mse","label":"MSE Nacos","group":"vpc","zones":["a","b"],"why":"Service discovery and configuration for all microservices."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-ack-mse","from":"ack","to":"mse","label":"discovery","kind":"control"}
{"t":"node","id":"mq","product":"rocketmq","label":"RocketMQ","group":"vpc","zones":["a","b"],"why":"Async messaging between the 20 services."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-ack-mq","from":"ack","to":"mq","label":"events","kind":"async"}
{"t":"node","id":"cache","product":"tair","label":"Tair Cache","group":"vpc","zones":["a","b"],"why":"Shared cache for sessions and hot data."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-ack-cache","from":"ack","to":"cache"}
{"t":"node","id":"db","product":"polardb","label":"PolarDB","group":"vpc","zones":["a","b"],"why":"Relational database for persistent storage."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-ack-db","from":"ack","to":"db","label":"SQL"}
{"t":"node","id":"acr","product":"acr","label":"Container Registry","group":"sg","why":"Stores container images for the microservices."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-acr-ack","from":"acr","to":"ack","label":"images","kind":"control"}
{"t":"node","id":"logs","product":"sls","label":"Log Service","group":"sg","why":"Centralized logging and monitoring for all services."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-ack-logs","from":"ack","to":"logs","kind":"control"}
{"t":"done","summary":"Kubernetes microservices platform with ACK, MSE Nacos, API Gateway, RocketMQ, Tair and PolarDB in two zones."}

{"t":"say","text":"I'll design a highly available two-zone web store in Singapore, fronted by ESA with WAF on the ALB, and Auto Scaling for sales peaks."}
{"t":"plan","products":["users","dns","esa","alb","waf","ecs","ess","tair","rds","oss","sls"]}
{"t":"group","id":"internet","kind":"external","label":"Internet","parent":null}
{"t":"node","id":"users","product":"users","label":"Shoppers","group":"internet","why":"30,000 daily users browsing the store."}
{"t":"node","id":"dns","product":"dns","label":"Cloud DNS","group":null,"why":"Resolves the store domain to ESA."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-users-dns","from":"users","to":"dns","kind":"resolve"}
{"t":"group","id":"edge","kind":"edge","label":"Edge","parent":null}
{"t":"node","id":"esa","product":"esa","label":"ESA","group":"edge","why":"Caches pages and images, accelerates dynamic traffic across Southeast Asia."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-users-esa","from":"users","to":"esa","label":"HTTPS"}
{"t":"group","id":"sg","kind":"region","label":"Singapore (ap-southeast-1)","parent":null}
{"t":"group","id":"vpc","kind":"vpc","label":"Store VPC","parent":"sg"}
{"t":"node","id":"alb","product":"alb","label":"ALB","group":"vpc","zones":["a","b"],"why":"Spreads traffic over both zones for high availability."}
{"t":"node","id":"waf","product":"waf","label":"WAF","group":"vpc","attachTo":"alb","why":"Blocks injection attacks and bots before the app."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-esa-alb","from":"esa","to":"alb","label":"origin"}
{"t":"node","id":"app","product":"ecs","label":"Web servers","group":"vpc","zones":["a","b"],"why":"Runs the store application across two zones."}
{"t":"node","id":"scaling","product":"ess","label":"Auto Scaling","group":"vpc","attachTo":"app","why":"Adds servers automatically during big sales peaks."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-alb-app","from":"alb","to":"app"}
{"t":"say","text":"Sessions go to Tair and orders to RDS, both deployed across two zones for high availability."}
{"t":"node","id":"cache","product":"tair","label":"Session cache","group":"vpc","zones":["a","b"],"why":"Keeps carts and sessions fast with zone-level HA."}
{"t":"node","id":"db","product":"rds","label":"Orders DB","group":"vpc","zones":["a","b"],"why":"Stores orders with a standby in the second zone."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-app-cache","from":"app","to":"cache"}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-app-db","from":"app","to":"db","label":"SQL"}
{"t":"node","id":"media","product":"oss","label":"Product images","group":"sg","why":"Stores product images that ESA serves from the edge."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-esa-media","from":"esa","to":"media","label":"images"}
{"t":"node","id":"logs","product":"sls","label":"Logs","group":"sg","why":"Central logs and alerts for operations."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-app-logs","from":"app","to":"logs","kind":"control"}
{"t":"done","summary":"Two-zone Singapore web store behind ESA, ALB with WAF, ECS with Auto Scaling, Tair cache and RDS database."}

{"t":"say","text":"I'll draw a RAG assistant architecture: employees query an AgentCore agent that retrieves answers from your docs via Model Studio and a vector store."}
{"t":"plan","products":["users","agentcore","model-studio","milvus","oss","sls"]}
{"t":"group","id":"internet","kind":"external","label":"Internal users","parent":null}
{"t":"node","id":"users","product":"users","label":"Employees","group":"internet","why":"Staff asking policy and wiki questions."}
{"t":"group","id":"sg","kind":"region","label":"Singapore (ap-southeast-1)","parent":null}
{"t":"node","id":"agentcore","product":"agentcore","label":"AgentCore","group":"sg","why":"Hosts the RAG agent with skills and MCP tools for employees."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-users-agentcore","from":"users","to":"agentcore","label":"chat"}
{"t":"node","id":"model-studio","product":"model-studio","label":"Model Studio","group":"sg","why":"Runs Qwen models to generate answers from retrieved context."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-agentcore-model","from":"agentcore","to":"model-studio","label":"LLM calls"}
{"t":"node","id":"vector","product":"milvus","label":"Milvus vector store","group":"sg","why":"Stores embeddings of policy docs and wiki pages for retrieval."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-agentcore-vector","from":"agentcore","to":"vector","label":"search"}
{"t":"node","id":"docs","product":"oss","label":"Document bucket","group":"sg","why":"Holds raw policy PDFs and wiki exports for ingestion."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-docs-vector","from":"docs","to":"vector","label":"ingest","kind":"async"}
{"t":"node","id":"logs","product":"sls","label":"Log Service","group":"sg","why":"Captures agent traces and logs for monitoring."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-agentcore-logs","from":"agentcore","to":"logs","kind":"control"}
{"t":"rec","product":"qwenwork","fit":"complement","why":"Ready-made workplace agent if you prefer not to build custom RAG pipelines."}
{"t":"done","summary":"RAG assistant built on AgentCore, Model Studio and Milvus over OSS documents, with SLS logging."}

{"t":"say","text":"I'll draw a real-time IoT telemetry pipeline in Singapore: devices connect via IoT Platform, stream through Kafka and Flink for anomaly detection, store in Lindorm, and visualize on DataV."}
{"t":"plan","products":["iot-devices","iot-platform","kafka","flink","lindorm","datav","sls","cloudmonitor"]}
{"t":"group","id":"external","kind":"external","label":"Field devices","parent":null}
{"t":"node","id":"devices","product":"iot-devices","label":"100K IoT devices","group":"external","why":"Sensors sending telemetry every few seconds."}
{"t":"group","id":"sg","kind":"region","label":"Singapore (ap-southeast-1)","parent":null}
{"t":"group","id":"vpc","kind":"vpc","label":"IoT VPC","parent":"sg"}
{"t":"node","id":"iot","product":"iot-platform","label":"IoT Platform","group":"sg","why":"Ingests MQTT telemetry from 100K devices and routes to Kafka."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-devices-iot","from":"devices","to":"iot","label":"MQTT"}
{"t":"node","id":"kafka","product":"kafka","label":"Kafka","group":"vpc","why":"Buffers high-throughput telemetry streams for Flink."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-iot-kafka","from":"iot","to":"kafka","label":"stream","kind":"async"}
{"t":"node","id":"flink","product":"flink","label":"Flink","group":"vpc","why":"Real-time SQL stream processing for anomaly detection."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-kafka-flink","from":"kafka","to":"flink","label":"consume"}
{"t":"node","id":"tsdb","product":"lindorm","label":"Lindorm TSDB","group":"vpc","why":"Stores time-series telemetry at massive scale."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-flink-tsdb","from":"flink","to":"tsdb","label":"write"}
{"t":"node","id":"dash","product":"datav","label":"DataV dashboard","group":"sg","why":"Live large-screen visualization of device metrics."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-tsdb-dash","from":"tsdb","to":"dash","label":"query"}
{"t":"node","id":"logs","product":"sls","label":"SLS","group":"sg","why":"Collects anomaly alert logs for audit and search."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-flink-logs","from":"flink","to":"logs","label":"alerts","kind":"async"}
{"t":"node","id":"monitor","product":"cloudmonitor","label":"CloudMonitor","group":"sg","why":"Monitors pipeline health and triggers ops alarms."}
{"t":"edge","id":"e-flink-monitor","from":"flink","to":"monitor","kind":"control"}
{"t":"done","summary":"IoT telemetry pipeline: IoT Platform → Kafka → Flink anomaly detection → Lindorm TSDB with DataV live dashboard and SLS alert logging."}

{"t":"say","text":"I'll draw a data platform in Singapore: RDS MySQL replicated via DTS to MaxCompute for batch, Hologres for serving, and Quick BI for dashboards."}
{"t":"plan","products":["rds","dts","maxcompute","dataworks","hologres","quick-bi","oss","sls"]}
{"t":"group","id":"sg","kind":"region","label":"Singapore (ap-southeast-1)","parent":null}
{"t":"group","id":"vpc","kind":"vpc","label":"Data Platform VPC","parent":"sg"}
